window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Kingdom Rescue</p> <p>Magic locked away. A kingdom lost to time. A rebellion that begins with a flame.</p> <p>Issalitia was once a land of blooming magic and wonder—now, it festers under the cruel rule of a tyrant king who cages his people inside their only escape is to live happily or run away and die at nightfall. Arysalia, the defiant Spring Fae princess, is tired of living without adventure. Alongside her fiercely loyal best friend Samarra, she dares to challenge the king by stealing what he loves most.</p> <p>But the goddesses stir when Finox, the illusionist King of Valador, stumbles upon the locked kingdom with a smirk on his lips and chaos in his wake. Trickster, king, or something more—Finox may be the key to helping the sister kingdom of Issalitia. At his side is his wind wielder,Goren, a stoic man with a storm behind his eyes and a burning vow to protect the one he loves.As ancient magic awakens and monstrous truths arise from the ashes, unlikely alliances are forged in fire, illusion,flowers, and trust. But in a kingdom held prisoner by lies, freedom comes at a cost—and not everyone will survive the price of freedom.Perfect for fans of romantic fantasy, fae magic, and daring friends, The Kingdom Rescue invites you into a world where every lie hides a legend—and every heart has its own kind of magic.</p>"; 
